\section{Classifiers}{

The package supports multiple classifiers:
\itemize{
\item LR: Logistic Regression (L1/L2 regularization)
\item RF: Random Forest
\item SVM: Support Vector Machine
\item NB: Naive Bayes
\item DT: Decision Tree
\item XGB: XGBoost (if installed)
}
